<title>USA: Greensboro, N.C., repriced, top yield 5.40 pct.</title>
<headline>Greensboro, N.C., repriced, top yield 5.40 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Robinson-Humphrey Co. said Wednesday it repriced Greensboro, N.C.'s $16 million bond deal. The top yield was 5.40 percent in 2013.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
